      "description": "Stacked whole-sentence choice; lifts on hover.",
      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><button class=\"ds-choice\">Ma lugesin raamatu läbi.</button><button class=\"ds-choice ds-picked\">Ma lugesin raamatut läbi.</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-choice{font:400 14.5px/1.45 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;text-align:left;padding:10px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e3e3de);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg,#faf9f6);color:var(--ink,#1b1b19);cursor:pointer;transition:box-shadow 130ms,transform 130ms,border-color 130ms}.ds-choice:hover{border-color:var(--accent,#1c6b52);box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(16,18,20,.07),0 16px 34px -16px rgba(16,18,20,.28);transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-choice:active{transform:none}.ds-picked{border-color:var(--accent,#1c6b52);background:var(--accent-soft,#e6f2ec)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Correction Card",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "correction",
      "description": "Wrong form struck in red, right form in forest; amber stripe for obj-case.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-corr\"><span class=\"ds-tag\">obj-case</span><p class=\"ds-fix\"><del>raamatut</del> <ins>raamatu</ins></p><p class=\"ds-why\">Действие завершено — объект в <b>omastav</b>.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-corr{font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;border:1px solid var(--line,#e3e3de);border-left:3px solid var(--warn,#9a5b00);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg,#faf9f6)}.ds-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--warn-soft,#fdf3e3);color:var(--warn,#9a5b00)}.ds-fix{margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:15px}.ds-fix del{color:var(--bad,#a32c2c)}.ds-fix ins{color:var(--good,#1c6b52);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}.ds-why{margin:0;color:var(--muted,#6b6b66);font-size:13.5px}.ds-why b{color:var(--ink,#1b1b19)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Progress Ring",
